   <indicator ascending="0" measure="5">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Output Indicator</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">1. Number of new data sources used at Country Office level.
2. Variety of innovation methods used to test and iterate over the different hypotheses.
3. Learning the Accelerator Lab Network shares with a public audience (outside of UNDP) 
4. Number of lab insights, processes or products which are taken up by governments or other partners 
5. Number of new models, approaches, and insights documented and  disseminated throughout the network..</narrative>
    </description>
