     <comment>
      <narrative xml:lang="EN">Output1: 0
Output 2: 0
Output 3: 0</narrative>
     </comment>
    </baseline>
    <period>
     <period-start iso-date="2021-01-01"></period-start>
     <period-end iso-date="2021-12-31"></period-end>
     <target>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">1. 2 new sources of data per year 
2. 2 innovation methods per Action Plan
3. 3 blogs, or other (substantial) media posts published per year. 
4. At least 50% of our learning challenges have the public sector or other partner as counterpart. 
5. 5% of information shared across the network should be methodology, or sustainable development issue and opportunity related.</narrative>
      </comment>
     </target>
     <actual>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">1. A-lab completed 2 official research studies as well as number of workshops and engagements.
2. 2 (Community Crowd-sourcing, Citizens intelligence)
3. Yes (Blog, facebook and twitter posts, meetings with government and private sector, workshops)
4. 0
5. No</narrative>
      </comment>
     </actual>
    </period>
    <period>
     <period-start iso-date="2022-01-01"></period-start>
     <period-end iso-date="2022-12-31"></period-end>
     <target>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">1.1 Average of 4 new data sources used per learning challenge
1.2 Average Total of 10 different types of data sources per Lab.
1.3 30 solutions uploaded to the platform
1.4 Average of 4 innovation methods per learning challenge
2.1 12 blogs, videos, or other (substantial) media posts.
2.2 Labs have contributed with local governments to build Innovation Policy, capacity building or intake of innovation method
2.3 labs have completed portfolio sensemaking exercise with the country office
3.1 Each lab should interact at least once a week with another lab, a partner, and the global team.
3.2 Information shared across the network</narrative>
      </comment>
     </target>
     <actual>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">1.1 2 new studies
1.2 average is 3 data sources: official, surveys and studies, social media
1.3 6 solutions uploaded
1.4 Average 3 innovation methods for learning
2.1 3 blog posts, 3 facebook and twitter posts
2.2 3 (Smart Erdenet waste logistics center and mobility application were handed over to the government, Digital literacy content was placed in the government)
2.3 Portfolio sensemaking was completed in 2021, portfolio development continued throughout 2022
3.1 Interacted once a week with global team through drop in sessions
3.2 4 experiments shared on the experiment platform as well as solution mappers platform</narrative>
      </comment>
